    <h3>iPhone and iPad themes</h3>
  <p>In Settings → Appearance, choose Gus Default, Apple Default, or a custom accent with the system color picker. Theme is saved on this device and is separate from light or dark appearance. Closing Now Playing keeps prepared audio available in the mini-player.</p>
